ntract and cross-repo header links[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the Rust-owned staging manifest, pool naming, prompt link [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewriting, ARTIFACTS header section, and absolute PLAN/PROMPT targets, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus their pyo3 bindings.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Local .sase/artifacts staging at prompt launch[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]stage[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage: capture every prompt artifact reference into the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]content-addressed .sase/artifacts pool, move .sase/home under it, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record one manifest row per reference.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agents sidecar prompt and artifact archive written by sase [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]commit[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]archive[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, stage[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive: write prompts/<YYYYMM>/ and artifacts/<YYYYMM>/ into the agents[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar at commit time, with inline artifact links, month indexes, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]locking, and outbox retry.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plan and prompt cross-repo linkage[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]crosslink[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, archive[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]crosslink: point plan PROMPT bullets at the agents sidecar, point [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]archived prompts back at their plans, and stop writing prompt snapshots [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into the plans sidecar.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][